                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>On a successful barbed net Strike, the stooge's target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] and takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds. On a critical hit, the creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained] instead. The target can attempt to [[/act escape dc=22]] to end the effect, or a creature adjacent to the target can Interact with the net to remove it. Each time a creature attempts to Escape or Interact to remove the net, it takes @Damage[1d6[piercing]] damage from the net's barbs, regardless of whether the attempt succeeds.</p>"
